      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The graph evidence confirms all needed join edges exist: LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED ↔ TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED, IAP_SUBJECT_DETAIL ↔ ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL, and both ↔ COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED. Let me try the database once more with the full candidate query:\n\n",
